# out/ is rebuilt from the library by the scripts. What holds lyric text (paren texts, cue
# texts) stays local; the baseline (timings and line ids only) and the song list are kept,
# since a library regen would change what they were read from. The Phase 2 song list is kept
# for the same reason; its report holds lyric text and stays local.
out/*
!out/baseline.json
!out/songs.json
!out/phase2_songs.json
__pycache__/
